cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying language model
  pretraining report and record software version 0.2.0a0 or the exact Git
  commit used.
title: "UE5M3 FP4: Language Model Pretraining Software"
type: software
version: "0.2.0a0"
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrHuff/ue5m3-fp4"
url: "https://github.com/MrHuff/ue5m3-fp4"
abstract: >-
  The released numerical reference, CUDA/Triton fake-quantization and
  probe-matched GEMM path, public TorchTitan method-reproduction integration,
  and audited result artifacts for UE5M3 FP4 language model pretraining. The
  public data pipeline reconstructs the method but not the unavailable
  byte-identical historical data and evaluation order.
keywords:
  - FP4
  - UE5M3
  - block scaling
  - language model
  - low-precision training
  - quantization
